OL,11,G0232 Tech Life
OL,12,     FHumanoid robots have successfully
OL,13,     Fperformed surgery in an operating
OL,14,     Ftheatre for the first time. They
OL,15,     Fwere remotely controlled by
OL,16,     Fsurgeons. An expert involved talks
OL,17,     Fto Tech Life.
