OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FWhat began as small talk about
OL,7,     Fchildren on the Tube led Gini
OL,8,     FBhogal to make an unusual promise,
OL,9,     Fhelping a stranger become a mother
OL,10,     Fwhile keeping a secret from her
OL,11,     Fown family.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1985, one the world's most
OL,14,     Frecognisable fashion accessories
OL,15,     Fwas first launched, the Birkin
OL,16,     Fbag. It was named after the singer
OL,17,     Fand actor Jane Birkin who inspired
OL,18,     Fthe design.
